mma":"சுட்டு","gloss":"pointing"}],"gloss":"pointing"},{"surface":"நக்கி","parts":[{"text":"நக்கி","lemma":"நக்கு","gloss":"licking"}],"gloss":"licking"},{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"like that"}],"gloss":"like that"},{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதலர்","lemma":"காதலர்","gloss":"lover"}],"gloss":"lover"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்கார்","parts":[{"text":"நல்கார்","lemma":"நல்கு","gloss":"he does not grant grace"}],"gloss":"he does not grant grace"},{"surface":"நயவார்","parts":[{"text":"நயவார்","lemma":"நய","gloss":"he does not desire"}],"gloss":"he does not desire"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"ஆயினும்","gloss":"even if"}],"gloss":"even if"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பல்கால்","parts":[{"text":"பல்கால்","lemma":"பல்கால்","gloss":"many times"}],"gloss":"many times","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காண்டலும்","parts":[{"text":"காண்டல்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"seeing"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even seeing"},{"surface":"உள்ளத்துக்கு","parts":[{"text":"உள்ளத்துக்கு","lemma":"உள்ளத்துக்கு","gloss":"to the heart"}],"gloss":"to the heart","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இனிதே","parts":[{"text":"இனிது","lemma":"இனிது","gloss":"sweet thing"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is sweet indeed"}]}],"literal":"On the high mountain slope where short-stemmed kūtali plants wave, / a lame man with dark legs who saw a large honeycomb, / shaping the hollow of his hand into a small cup and sitting below, / pointing and licking in that manner, the lover, / even if he does not grant grace and does not desire, / seeing many times is sweet indeed to the heart.","translation":"On the high mountain slope where short-stemmed kūtali plants wave, a lame man with stiff legs sees a large honeycomb high up. Unable to climb, he sits below, shapes his hand into a small cup, points at it, and licks his fingers in anticipation. Just like that, even if my lover does not grant me his grace or desire me, seeing him many times is sweet indeed to my heart.","modern":"குறுகிய தண்டுடைய கூதளிச் செடிகள் அசையும் உயர்ந்த மலையில், பெரிய தேன்கூட்டைப் பார்த்த முடவன் ஒருவன், தன் உள்ளங்கையைக் குவித்துச் சிறிய குடை போல ஆக்கிக் கீழே அமர்ந்து, அத்தேனைச் சுட்டிக்காட்டித் தன் விரலை நக்குவது போல; காதலர் எனக்கு அருள் செய்யாமலும் என்னை விரும்பாமலும் இருந்தாலும், அவரைப் பலமுறை காண்பது மட்டுமே என் நெஞ்சத்திற்கு இன்பம் தருகிறது.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Kuriñci (mountain) landscape, where the heroine is speaking to her confidante about her unrequited or distant lover. She uses a vivid mountain image of a lame man who spots a massive honeycomb high up on a steep cliff. Because he cannot climb to reach it, he sits at the bottom, shapes his hand into a cup, points at the honey, and licks his fingers in imaginary satisfaction. In the same way, even though her lover does not show her affection or grant her union, she finds a bittersweet comfort in merely looking at him from afar. The key words are 'muṭavaṉ' (lame man), 'peruntēṉ' (large honeycomb), and 'kāṇṭalum uḷḷattukku iṉitē' (even seeing is sweet to the heart).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.44],[0.44,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,2.48],[2.48,3.0],[3.0,3.7],[3.7,4.1],[4.45,4.8],[4.8,5.5],[5.5,5.9],[5.93,6.1],[6.1,6.92],[7.2,7.4],[7.4,7.7],[7.7,8.0],[8.0,8.57],[8.57,9.0],[9.0,9.4],[9.4,10.02],[10.02,10.8],[10.8,11.22],[11.22,12.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.7],[1.7,2.29],[2.29,2.65],[2.65,3.24],[3.24,4.4],[4.4,5.05],[5.05,5.7],[5.7,6.19],[6.19,7.01],[7.01,7.66],[7.66,8.15],[8.15,8.8],[8.8,9.7],[9.7,10.16],[10.16,10.5],[10.5,11.1],[11.1,11.81],[11.81,12.7],[12.7,13.2],[13.2,14.0]]},"sync":[[["குறுந்தாள்","short-stemmed"]],[["கூதளி","kūtali plant"]],[["ஆடிய","waved"]],[["நெடுவரை","high mountain slope"]],[["பெருந்தேன்","large honeycomb"]],[["கண்ட","seen"]],[["இருங்கால்","dark-legged"]],[["முடவன்","lame man"]],[["உட்கை","hollow of the hand"]],[["சிறுகுடை","small cup-like shape"]],[["கோலி","having shaped"],["கீழிருந்து","sitting below"]],[["கீழிருந்து","sitting below"]],[["சுட்டுபு","pointing"]],[["நக்கி","licking"]],[["ஆங்கு","like that"]],[["காதலர்","lover"]],[["நல்கார்","he does not grant grace"]],[["நயவார்","he does not desire"]],[["நயவார்","he does not desire"],["ஆயினும்","even if"]],[["பல்கால்","many times"]],[["காண்டலும்","even seeing"]],[["உள்ளத்துக்கு","to the heart"]],[["உள்ளத்துக்கு","to the heart"],["இனிதே","is sweet indeed"]]]}